  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:echo_shatter",
      "text": [
        "The Earth station, and the first one you will build. Echo Shatter has two jobs: breaking **stone** into Echo Shards, the crystal that powers a Pulse Resonator, and crushing blocks and ores into something smaller."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Making shards",
      "text": [
        "Put **stone** or **deepslate** in; March Stone works too. Cobblestone does not make shards, so smelt it to stone first.",
        "A shard takes **2 seconds** at **16 Pulse a second** before pack settings. A reserve lets a slower generator finish a batch.",
        "It needs an Earth totem within 8 blocks and a charged generator. The shard is the small, reusable catalyst for your first Pulse Resonator."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Crushing",
      "text": [
        "- Cobblestone, cobbled deepslate and March Cobble become gravel; gravel becomes sand.",
        "- Sand becomes dust when the supported sieving mod is installed, or clay otherwise.",
        "- Diorite becomes quartz. March Ore becomes two Spirit Shards.",
        "- Raw metals and metal ores become **two grit** each, in 4 seconds at 20 Pulse a second before pack settings. See [Metals and gems](metals_and_gems).",
        "- Silk-touched gem ores shatter straight to the gem, at twice the ore's own drop.",
        "Recipes in this book, or JEI, show the exact inputs and outputs in your pack."
      ]
    },
